        "TileImage": "$($repository 415319ba-b510-49e4-9bcc-be6d678afe7f).Image",
        "Description": "Hello 47, \r\rour investigation has taken us to Chongqing. Donnie Demiraca, a Chilean dumpling chef, has been quietly passing information through his network of contacts. Liu Xia, a local mechanic, provides vehicles and logistical support to the same circle. Neither man appears particularly dangerous, but both are connected to the network surrounding Parisi. Remove them, and we may finally learn who is pulling the strings.\r\rGood Luck, 47.",
